@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam titleBorderRoundCorner 10

title <size:18><b>E-Commerce Admin Dashboard</b></size>\n<size:14>Sequence Diagram - Alur Aplikasi</size>

' ===== Warna =====
skinparam actorStyle awesome

' Participant colors
skinparam participant {
  BorderColor #4F46E5
  FontColor #1E293B
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EEF2FF

' Custom colors per participant
skinparam participantBorderColor #4F46E5

' Database
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
skinparam databaseBorderColor #10B981

' Boundaries
skinparam boundaryBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam boundaryBorderColor #F59E0B

' Collections
skinparam collectionsBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam collectionsBorderColor #64748B

' ===== Participants =====
actor "User" as User
boundary "main.jsx\n(Entry Point)" as Main
participant "App.jsx\n(Root Component)" as App
participant "AuthContext.jsx\n(Global State)" as Auth
collections "ProtectedRoute.jsx\n(Guard)" as Guard
collections "AppRoutes.jsx\n(Router Config)" as Routes
participant "Login.jsx\n(Login Page)" as LoginPage
participant "Dashboard.jsx\n(Home Page)" as Dashboard
participant "ProductList.jsx\n(CRUD Page)" as ProductList
participant "ProductForm.jsx\n(Add/Edit)" as ProductForm
database "services/\nAPI Layer" as Services
database "DummyJSON\n(REST API)" as API

' ===== Flows =====

== 1. Startup Aplikasi ==

User -> Main: Buka aplikasi
Main -> App: createRoot().render(<App />)
App -> Auth: <AuthProvider>\nCek localStorage token

alt Token tidak ditemukan
    Auth --> App: user = null, token = null
    App -> Routes: Render <AppRoutes />
    Routes -> Guard: Route "/" → <ProtectedRoute />
    Guard --> Routes: Token null → Redirect /login
    Routes -> LoginPage: Render <Login />

else Token ditemukan
    Auth --> App: user = token tersimpan\n(dari localStorage)
    App -> Routes: Render <AppRoutes />
    Routes -> Guard: Route "/" → <ProtectedRoute />
    Guard --> Routes: Token valid → Allow
    Routes -> Dashboard: Render <Dashboard />
end

== 2. Login Flow ==

User -> LoginPage: Input username & password
LoginPage -> Auth: login(username, password)
Auth -> Services: authService.loginUser()
Services -> API: POST /auth/login
API --> Services: { accessToken, id, username }
Services --> Auth: Response data
Auth -> Auth: setToken(accessToken)\nsetUser({ id, username })\nsimpan token ke localStorage
Auth --> LoginPage: Login sukses
LoginPage -> LoginPage: navigate("/")
LoginPage -> Routes: Redirect ke Dashboard

== 3. CRUD Flow (Contoh: Lihat Produk) ==

User -> Dashboard: Klik menu "Products"
Dashboard -> Routes: navigate("/products")
Routes -> Guard: Validasi token
Guard --> Routes: Token valid
Routes -> ProductList: Render <ProductList />
ProductList -> Services: productService.getProducts()
Services -> API: GET /products?limit=30
API --> Services: Array produk
Services --> ProductList: Products data
ProductList -> ProductList: Render tabel produk

== 4. CRUD Flow (Tambah/Edit/Hapus) ==

User -> ProductList: Klik "Add Product"
ProductList -> Routes: navigate("/products/new")
Routes -> ProductForm: Render <ProductForm />
User -> ProductForm: Isi form & submit
ProductForm -> Services: createProduct(payload)
Services -> API: POST /products/add
API --> Services: Produk baru
Services --> ProductForm: Success
ProductForm -> ProductList: navigate("/products")

User -> ProductList: Klik "Delete"
ProductList -> ProductList: Tampil modal konfirmasi
User -> ProductList: Konfirmasi hapus
ProductList -> Services: deleteProduct(id)
Services -> API: DELETE /products/:id
API --> Services: Success
Services --> ProductList: Hapus dari state lokal
ProductList -> ProductList: Update tabel

@enduml
